  "htmlPage": {
    "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/records/rules/10-10-weapons/"
  },
  "section": "10.10",
  "rulesText": "A magic weapon is typically a magical version of a weapon from “Equipment.” Some magic weapons specify the type of weapon they are in their descriptions, such as a Longsword or Longbow. If no weapon type is specified, you may choose the type or determine it randomly.\n\nAmmunition. If a magic weapon has the Ammunition property, ammunition fired from it is considered magical for the purpose of any rule that cares whether a weapon is magical or not."
}
